              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni hakutachika kutuŋa itala daYehova kuYerusalema kumpidiya Moriya, kwamwekeneni Yehova kudi tata yindi Davidi, kwaloŋesheliyi kwokwateneniyi Davidi, kwokuwuhulilu wakaYebusi Orinani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwitala dasweja kujila wasoŋelelumu akerubi ayedi akusopa neyi chasopaŋawu nkishi, alami kiluhu wuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpúula jawakerubi jashikili munkotweli makumi ayedi; lupúula lumu lwakerubi lwankotweli jitanu, lwakwatili kumbapu yetala; lupúula lukwawu lwankotweli jitanu nawa, lwakwatili kulupúula lwakerubi mukwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lupúula lwakerubi mukwawulwankotweli jitanu, lwakwatili kumbapu yetala; lupúula lukwawulwankotweli jitanu nawa, lwabulakana nalupúula lwakerubi mukwawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
